--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@
 -*- Indented-text -*-
 
+Unreleased
+
+	- discard all completion-filter callback results before freeing
+	  temporaries, preventing stale values on the Perl stack and crashes
+	  with PERL_RC_STACK
+	- test completion filters with single, empty and sparse result lists
+
 1.47  2025-07-06
 	- readline-8.3 support
 	    new functions
--- a/Gnu.xs
+++ b/Gnu.xs
@@ -1511,6 +1511,9 @@
